  "measurement": {
    "x_axis": "For each of the 942 held-out query contexts, the maximum RAW (unwhitened) cosine between its layer-19 context vector and the context vector of any OTHER context in the 10,000-context candidate pool; the query's own position in the pool is excluded.  Recomputed from c2a_C.npy and c2a_qcols.npy in the same directory and matching the banked column to 3.0e-07.  Note the asymmetry: this axis is a raw cosine between CONTEXT vectors, while the failure/success split comes from whitened-cosine CSLS retrieval in ANSWER space.",
